<section id="crew" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1220px] rounded-[18px] px-4 sm:rounded-[26px] sm:px-8 md:rounded-[30px] md:px-12 py-7 sm:py-9 md:py-12 text-ink"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-11"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:gap-3.5"><p class="font-medium text-[10px] md:text-[11.5px] tracking-[0.15em] md:tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">THE PEOPLE WHO WILL BE IN YOUR HOUSE</p><h2 class="font-display font-bold text-[25px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.16] md:leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.005em] max-w-[54rem]">Four plumbers. That is the whole company.</h2><p class="max-w-[52rem] text-[15px] md:text-[17px] leading-[1.58] text-ink-soft">No subcontractors, no rotating strangers off an app. You will meet one of these four, and you will know which one before they knock.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4"><div id="crew-MH" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[20px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-6 py-[26px]"><div class="flex size-[66px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-action">MH</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px]"><p class="font-display text-[20px] font-bold text-ink">Marcus Hale</p><p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-soft">Owner · Master Plumber</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px] text-[13.5px] text-ink-mid"><p>19 years on the tools</p><p>Licence #PL-40219</p></div></div><div id="crew-NE" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[20px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-6 py-[26px]"><div class="flex size-[66px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-action">NE</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px]"><p class="font-display text-[20px] font-bold text-ink">Nate Ellis</p><p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-soft">Lead Plumber</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px] text-[13.5px] text-ink-mid"><p>11 years on the tools</p><p>Licence #PL-51882</p></div></div><div id="crew-DO" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[20px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-6 py-[26px]"><div class="flex size-[66px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-action">DO</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px]"><p class="font-display text-[20px] font-bold text-ink">Deb Ovechi</p><p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-soft">Plumber · Gas Fitter</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px] text-[13.5px] text-ink-mid"><p>8 years on the tools</p><p>Licence #PL-60114</p></div></div><div id="crew-TR" class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-[20px] border border-rule bg-subtle px-6 py-[26px]"><div class="flex size-[66px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-action">TR</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px]"><p class="font-display text-[20px] font-bold text-ink">Toby Ruiz</p><p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-ink-soft">Apprentice, 3rd year</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[5px] text-[13.5px] text-ink-mid"><p>3 years on the tools</p><p>Always supervised</p></div></div></div></div></section>
